 "punch": "BLOOD",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "slot": "T1",
   "text": "Why does this clown's party end in blood?",
   "kind": "HOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "clown's",
     "to": "pierrot_face"
    },
    {
     "on": "blood",
     "to": "blood"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T2",
   "text": "This is The Duel After the Masquerade, painted by Jean-Léon Gérôme in 1857.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 2
  },
  {
   "slot": "T3",
   "text": "Most people see a carnival that went on too long.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "carnival",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T3",
   "text": "A grey winter morning, bare trees, snow on the ground.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 13,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "snow",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T4",
   "text": "And the picture seems to agree.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "T4",
   "text": "A harlequin, a doge, a clown in white.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 15,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "harlequin",
     "to": "harlequin"
    },
    {
     "on": "doge",
     "to": "surgeon"
    },
    {
     "on": "clown",
     "to": "pierrot"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T5",
   "text": "But look at his white suit.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "suit",
     "to": "pierrot"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T6",
   "text": "There is blood on it.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "blood",
     "to": "blood"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T7",
   "text": "According to art historians, Gérôme painted the aftermath, never the fight itself.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 17
  },
  {
   "slot": "T7",
   "text": "The clown has been mortally wounded in a duel.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 14,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "wounded",
     "to": "pierrot_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T7",
   "text": "The winner walks away to his carriage and leaves his sword in the snow.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 16,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "winner",
     "to": "winner"
    },
    {
     "on": "sword",
     "to": "sword"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T8",
   "text": "It isn't a party.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "T8",
   "text": "It's the morning after, and someone is dying.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "dying",
     "to": "pierrot_face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "T9",
   "text": "So was it honour, or a costume quarrel that cost a life?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "life",
     "to": "pierrot_face"
    }
   ]
  }
